[12.719812, "o", "MITRE ATT&CK(R): (C) The MITRE Corporation, CC BY 4.0 (attack.mitre.org).\r\nCVE/CVSS: U.S. National Vulnerability Database, nvd.nist.gov (public-domain U.S.-Gov work).\r\nTHREAT INTELLIGENCE ADVISORY — Jenkins Groovy campaign\r\n======================================================\r\n\r\nDistribution: TLP:AMBER   Analyst handoff   Confidence: HIGH   (IOCs are defanged)\r\nAffected host: jenkins-prod-01   Suspected origin IP: 198.51.100.98\r\n\r\n1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\r\nAn external actor executed a multi-stage post-compromise sequence. Endpoint alerting covered only part of it; several persistence and anti-forensic actions were silent. Map every on-disk finding to the ATT&CK techniques below and flag which are NOT in the SAS alert feed.\r\n\r\n2. ATT&CK TECHNIQUE MAPPING (MITRE ATT&CK Enterprise)\r\n   T1190      Exploit Public-Facing Application          [initial-access]  step 1: Jenkins RCE (CVE-2024-23897)\r\n   T1059.004  Unix Shell                                 [execution]  step 2: Groovy/shell execution\r\n   T1496      Resource Hijacking                         [impact]  step 3: cryptomining\r\n   T1037.004  RC Scripts                                 [persistence]  step 4: Groovy init hook\r\n   T1098.004  SSH Authorized Keys                        [persistence]  step 5: authorized_keys backdoor\r\n   T1053.003  Cron                                       [execution]  step 6: cron persistence\r\n   T1070.002  Clear Linux or Mac System Logs             [defense-evasion]  step 7: Jenkins log truncation\r\n\r\n3. RELEVANT VULNERABILITIES (source: NVD, US-Gov public domain)\r\n   CVE-2024-23897  CVSS 9.8 (CRITICAL) v3.1  CWE=CWE-22,CWE-27\r\n      Jenkins 2.441 and earlier, LTS 2.426.2 and earlier does not disable a feature of its CLI command parser that replaces an '@' character followed by a file path in an argument with the file's contents, allowing unauthenticated attackers to re\r\n      ref: http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/176839/Jenkins-2.441-LTS-2.426.3-CVE-2024-23897-Scanner.html\r\n\r\n4. INDICATORS OF COMPROMISE (defanged)\r\n   ip     198.51.100.98\r\n   c2     update-jenkins[.]example[.]cn\r\n   pool   stratum+tcp[:]//xmr[.]jenkins[.]evil[:]3333\r\n   wallet 4A0000000000000000003d98ef6bc04b\r\n\r\nAttribution: MITRE ATT&CK(R) (C) The MITRE Corporation, CC BY 4.0. CVE/CVSS from the U.S. National Vulnerability Database (public domain).\r\n"]
