[74.777028, "o", "SYNTHETIC-INERT-SAMPLE (miner-process) ? not a runnable executable; content defanged for a DFIR evaluation. Original was a dropped binary; compute sha256 to record its hash.\r\n\r\nxmrig-family miner process (pid 1337) mining to pool stratum+tcp[:]//xmr[.]jenkins[.]evil[:]3333 (defanged) ? sustained high CPU\r\npool stratum+tcp[:]//xmr[.]jenkins[.]evil[:]3333\r\nwallet 4A0000000000000000003d98ef6bc04b\r\nconfig.json\r\n\r\n--- pseudo hexdump (benign filler) ---\r\n00000000  0b 30 55 7a 1f 44 69 0e 33 58 7d 22 47 6c 11 36\r\n00000010  5b 00 25 4a 6f 14 39 5e 03 28 4d 72 17 3c 61 06\r\n00000020  2b 50 75 1a 3f 64 09 2e 53 78 1d 42 67 0c 31 56\r\n00000030  7b 20 45 6a 0f 34 59 7e 23 48 6d 12 37 5c 01 26\r\n00000040  4b 70 15 3a 5f 04 29 4e 73 18 3d 62 07 2c 51 76\r\n00000050  1b 40 65 0a 2f 54 79 1e 43 68 0d 32 57 7c 21 46\r\n00000060  6b 10 35 5a 7f 24 49 6e 13 38 5d 02 27 4c 71 16\r\n00000070  3b 60 05 2a 4f 74 19 3e 63 08 2d 52 77 1c 41 66\r\n00000080  0b 30 55 7a 1f 44 69 0e 33 58 7d 22 47 6c 11 36\r\n00000090  5b 00 25 4a 6f 14 39 5e 03 28 4d 72 17 3c 61 06\r\n000000a0  2b 50 75 1a 3f 64 09 2e 53 78 1d 42 67 0c 31 56\r\n000000b0  7b 20 45 6a 0f 34 59 7e 23 48 6d 12 37 5c 01 26\r\n000000c0  4b 70 15 3a 5f 04 29 4e 73 18 3d 62 07 2c 51 76\r\n000000d0  1b 40 65 0a 2f 54 79 1e 43 68 0d 32 57 7c 21 46\r\n000000e0  6b 10 35 5a 7f 24 49 6e 13 38 5d 02 27 4c 71 16\r\n000000f0  3b 60 05 2a 4f 74 19 3e 63 08 2d 52 77 1c 41 66\r\n00000100  0b 30 55 7a 1f 44 69 0e 33 58 7d 22 47 6c 11 36\r\n00000110  5b 00 25 4a 6f 14 39 5e 03 28 4d 72 17 3c 61 06\r\n00000120  2b 50 75 1a 3f 64 09 2e 53 78 1d 42 67 0c 31 56\r\n00000130  7b 20 45 6a 0f 34 59 7e 23 48 6d 12 37 5c 01 26\r\n00000140  4b 70 15 3a 5f 04 29 4e 73 18 3d 62 07 2c 51 76\r\n00000150  1b 40 65 0a 2f 54 79 1e 43 68 0d 32 57 7c 21 46\r\n00000160  6b 10 35 5a 7f 24 49 6e 13 38 5d 02 27 4c 71 16\r\n00000170  3b 60 05 2a 4f 74 19 3e 63 08 2d 52 77 1c 41 66\r\n00000180  0b 30 55 7a 1f 44 69 0e 33 58 7d 22 47 