[128.908813, "i", "cat <<'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# DFIR Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\n\n## Incident Summary\n- **Target Machine:** Ubuntu 22.04 Jenkins Controller (`jenkins-prod-01`)\n- **Incident Type:** Post-Compromise Forensic Investigation & Remediation Planning\n- **Primary Entry Vector:** CVE-2024-23897 (Jenkins CLI Arbitrary File Read / RCE)\n- **Attacker IP:** `198.51.100.98` (cited at `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:6`, `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins:5`, `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/z-backdoor.groovy:3`)\n\n## Investigation Timeline\n| Time / Stage | Event Description | Evidence Citation |\n|---|---|---|\n| Initial Alerting | EDR & SAS alerts detect RCE artifact, cryptominer, cron job, and baseline weakness | `/sas/alerts.json:1` |\n| Vulnerability Identification | CVE-2024-23897 identified as the exploit mechanism | `/sas/vulns.json:3` |\n| Initial Access | Exploitation of Jenkins CLI RCE resulting in dropped RCE artifact | `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/jobs/.tmp/config.xml:3` |\n| Execution & Shell Access | Execution of Groovy script resulting in reverse shell thread creation | `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/z-backdoor.groovy:3` |\n| Cryptomining Deployment | XMRig miner executed under `/opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig` targeting pool `stratum+tcp://xmr.jenkins.evil:3333` | `/disk/opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig:1` |\n| Persistence - Cron | Crontab persistence added to periodically fetch C2 beacon from `198.51.100.98` | `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins:5` |\n| Persistence - Groovy Hook | Groovy init hook `z-backdoor.groovy` established for persistent startup execution | `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/z-backdoor.groovy:3` |\n| Persistence - SSH Backdoor | Attacker SSH key planted in Jenkins user `authorized_keys` | `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/authorized_keys:2` |\n| Defense Evasion / Anti-Forensics | Jenkins log wiped / truncated and C2 beacon metadata found in wiped cache binary | `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` |\n| Configuration Weakness | Security realm disabled (`useSecurity=false`), allowing unauthenticated administrative operations | `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/config.xml:3` |\n\n## Investigation Checklist\n- [x] Mount read-only forensic disk image at `/disk` and inspect structure\n- [x] Parse security alerts, vulnerability reports, and baseline checks in `/sas/alerts.json`, `/sas/vulns.json`, `/sas/baseline.json`\n- [x] Analyze vendor threat intelligence advisory in `/sas/cti/advisory.txt`\n- [x] Reconcile intake form in `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`\n- [x] Conduct full disk sweep of `/disk` for malicious files, scripts, binaries, and cron jobs\n- [x] Correlate alerted items vs. silent (non-alerted) persistence mechanisms:\n  - Alerted: RCE artifact (`/disk/var/lib/jenkins/jobs/.tmp/config.xml`), XMRig miner (`/disk/opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig`), Cron persistence (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins`), Jenkins baseline (`/disk/var/lib/jenkins/config.xml`)\n  - Silent: Groovy init hook (`/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/z-backdoor.groovy`), SSH authorized key backdoor (`/disk/var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/authorized_keys`)\n- [x] Reconcile draft change ticket `CHG-1700` (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md`):\n  - Correct stale IP from `203.0.113.9` to `198.51.100.98` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:6`)\n  - Correct wrong CVE from BlueKeep (CVE-2019-0708) to CVE-2024-23897 (`/sas/vulns.json:3`)\n  - Downgrade cron removal status from `DONE` to `OPEN` / `PROPOSED` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins:5`)\n  - Add missing silent persistence targets (Groovy hook, SSH authorized_keys, miner cleanup, configuration hardening)\n- [x] Generate required 5 DFIR report deliverables under `/app` (`progress.md`, `intrusion-report.md`, `vuln-report.md`, `baseline-report.md`, `remediation-plan.md`)\nEOF\n"]
[128.909461, "o", "cat <<'EOF' > /app/progress.md"]
[128.909785, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
