[152.380792, "o", "## 3. Baseline Audit Checklist Summary\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Check ID | Control / Baseline Item | Result | Target File | Citation |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> |---|---|---|---|---|\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | CHK-06 | Jenkins Security Realm (`useSecurity`) | FAIL | `/var/lib/jenkins/config.xml` | `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/config.xml:3` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | BAS-CUSTOM-01 | Groovy Init Directory Integrity | FAIL | `/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/` | `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/z-backdoor.groovy:3` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | BAS-CUSTOM-02 | User SSH Key Restrictions | FAIL | `/var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/authorized_keys` | `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/authorized_keys:2` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | CHK-05 | System Crontab Integrity | FAIL | `/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins` | `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins:5` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
